gin":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-30T23:44:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T23:44:04Z","body":"Note: Consensus so far is that this is an issue for Google to solve in AndroidXR. Problem has been reported and we assume this will be fixed in due time.\n\nWe'll keep this open until we have confirmation of the issue being fixed in the OS.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4356911138/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5967527401","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113778#issuecomment-5967527401","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113778","id":5967527401,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABY7E96Q","user":{"login":"DanielKinsman","id":15639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman","html_url":"https://github.com/DanielKinsman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-03T09:07:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T09:07:02Z","body":"I think there is more going on here than a vendor bug, I get something similar on natively on the steam frame. It *doesn't* make the entire image low res but foveation doesn't work at all unless FXAA is enabled.\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d2ee6c8-eff3-4303-9b70-497f88b62da8\" />\n\nAbove with FXAA enabled, I am looking at the left of the screenshot, so the right is low res. The performance benefits of foveation are there with it running stable-ish at 36 fps.\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/23a075e6-de3f-4c7a-aa14-5422e77ffe93\" />\n\nWith FXAA disabled and no other changes to the project, the entire image is the same res and the performance benefits of foveation are not seen with it running at 24 fps.\n\nIf you think this is a separate issue let me know and I'll log a new one.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5967527401/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5968985317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113778#issuecomment-5968985317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113778","id":5968985317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABY8d85Q","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-03T12:05:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T12:05:10Z","body":"> If you think this is a separate issue let me know and I'll log a new one.\n\nThis seems like a different issue with the same workaround. Enabling FXAA (or Glow or a couple other things) will disable subpasses, and so from your description it sounds like foveation isn't working on the Steam Frame unless subpasses are disabled?\n\nThat's quite different from the issue here, where foveation _does_ work, it's just a specific combination of things leads to a bad FDM being used with foveation (those things being MSAA + foveation + subpasses, and removing any one of those things will work fine)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5968985317/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]